   1:main.c        **** /* main.c — Geophone Filter Testbench Firmware
   2:main.c        ****  *
   3:main.c        ****  * Boot sequence:
   4:main.c        ****  *   1. Interrupts on
   5:main.c        ****  *   2. Debug system (UART) — first so boot events can be logged
   6:main.c        ****  *   3. ISR registration
   7:main.c        ****  *   4. Register USB transport (UART transport disabled by default)
   8:main.c        ****  *   5. Init all hardware modules; send debug event per module
   9:main.c        ****  *   6. Start ADC pipeline
  10:main.c        ****  *   7. Main loop: Communication_Task + sample dispatch
  11:main.c        ****  *
  12:main.c        ****  * State sync: after USB enumerates, Communication_SendState() is called once
  13:main.c        ****  * so Python immediately knows the PSoC's current config without guessing.
  14:main.c        ****  */
